  <h3>B.6 — Key <em>kind</em> is inconsistent</h3>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="panel">
      <h4>Stable text code</h4>
      <p class="note"><span class="m">ref_id</span> REF-00325 · <span class="m">item_code</span> A-01 ·
